
PROCESS BEFORE OUTPUT.

  MODULE status_2200.

*&SPWIZARD: PBO FLOW LOGIC FOR TABLECONTROL 'TCONT'
  MODULE tcont_change_tc_attr.
*&SPWIZARD: MODULE TCONT_CHANGE_COL_ATTR.
